          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Cross-board content injection: ingestOne inserts each post under the post's self-declared `board` field, and the cursor/reconcile sync path (ingestSince) never checks that field against the prefix it listed, so an object placed physically under boards/general but carrying \"board\":\"private\" is indexed into board `private` and shows up in board_threads/board_search/board_thread/resources for `private`; the changes()-feed path DOES filter (index.ts:205) but the default cursor path does not, and rebuild(general) cannot clear it because it scans the general prefix."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
