          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Thread ordering manipulation via attacker `ts`: post.ts is only Date.parse-checked (any parseable string incl. non-ISO), stored raw, and threads.last_activity is computed with TEXT max() and ordered DESC, so a post with a lexically large ts (e.g. 9999-... ) pins its thread permanently above all real activity and can push legitimate threads out of the default limit window in board_threads and thread resources."
          },
