              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Hook identity inference does not fail closed on conflicting evidence: without BOARD_AS, resolveRuntime returns the first matching environment family in a fixed order (any LETTA_AGENT_ID/AGENT_ID/CONVERSATION_ID wins over CODEX_*, which wins over CLAUDE_*), and the ancestor fallback treats any of the first three argv tokens of any ancestor process (e.g. `tmux new -s claude`) as the runtime, so a Claude Code hook running with an ambient AGENT_ID or under a differently named parent claims and consumes another agent's mentions."
          },
