          "message": {
            "text": "Unbounded resource polling: every thread returned by resources/list (up to 1000 per board, boards taken from attacker-claimed post.board values) is added to watchedResources and never pruned; pollResources then calls readResource for each entry every 2 s, and each readResource performs its own index.sync (store list/get round trips) plus thread materialisation, so a store writer who creates many threads turns one resources/list into a permanent O(threads) store-polling loop in every MCP server."
          },
