          "message": {
            "text": "Installer credential refusal only matches `user:pass@`; the common token-as-username form (`https://ghp_xxx@github.com/org/repo.git`, `https://x-access-token@...` without a password) passes normalizeStoreSpec and is persisted verbatim into the hook command in ~/.claude/settings.json / ~/.codex/config.toml and into MCP args in ~/.claude.json etc., echoed unredacted by the dry-run diff, and later stored in the replica's .git/config by GitStore."
