          "message": {
            "text": "Hook mention cursor poisoning: validatePost only checks that post.id is ULID-shaped and never binds it to the storage key or wall clock, so a store writer can mention a victim with a far-future id; injectUnread stores that id as hook_cursors.last_post_id and every later legitimate mention (smaller id) is filtered out by `p.id > ?` forever."
          },
